<title>USA: McIntosh ISD 2609, Minn. won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>McIntosh ISD 2609, Minn. won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it won $7.9 million of McIntosh Independent Sch Dist No. 2609, Minn., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.323 percent.</p>
</text>
